[3] The appellant has prayed for the following reliefs:-
i) Admit this Appeal;
ii) Call for records relevant to the subject matter of the case from the Learned Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Sepahijala District, Sonamura pertaining to the Case No.
T.S. (MAC) 11 of 2020;
iii) After hearing the parties be pleased enough to set aside/quash and modify the impugned judgment and award dated 30.11.2024, passed by Learned Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Sepahijala District, Sonamura in Case No. T.S. (MAC) 11 of 2020,
